    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to The Mirage: Your shift starts now \ud83c\udf83</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Manny's Murderous Movie Theater</strong> is a free prologue to <strong>Massacre at the Mirage</strong>! If you enjoy Manny's, be sure to check out the full game, which includes both simulation and story modes. <strong>Massacre at the Mirage</strong> launches on October 28\u2014add it to your wishlist on Steam now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/99f000fe5f481ebe433200f356dadfe1.poster.avif?t=1728901914\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/99f000fe5f481ebe433200f356dadfe1.webm?t=1728901914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/99f000fe5f481ebe433200f356dadfe1.mp4?t=1728901914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into The Mirage, the beloved cinema of this quaint town, and get ready for the chaos! Guests are craving their favorite snacks, and they're not going to be patient. Meanwhile, Manny the Clown\u2014the masked killer and cinema manager\u2014is lurking close, ensuring your service meets his gruesome standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/3e3d463024faf4e1dd0bb8d32c65f6ca.avif?t=1728901914\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7f Serve moviegoers their favorite snacks and keep them satisfied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfec Upgrade your shop to handle the ever-growing, insatiable crowds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Harvest pockets (and possibly organs) to meet your quotas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Customize your experience with spooky collectibles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to The Mirage: Your shift starts now \ud83c\udf83</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Manny's Murderous Movie Theater</strong> is a free prologue to <strong>Massacre at the Mirage</strong>! If you enjoy Manny's, be sure to check out the full game, which includes both simulation and story modes. <strong>Massacre at the Mirage</strong> launches on October 28\u2014add it to your wishlist on Steam now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/99f000fe5f481ebe433200f356dadfe1.poster.avif?t=1728901914\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/99f000fe5f481ebe433200f356dadfe1.webm?t=1728901914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/99f000fe5f481ebe433200f356dadfe1.mp4?t=1728901914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into The Mirage, the beloved cinema of this quaint town, and get ready for the chaos! Guests are craving their favorite snacks, and they're not going to be patient. Meanwhile, Manny the Clown\u2014the masked killer and cinema manager\u2014is lurking close, ensuring your service meets his gruesome standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232460/extras/3e3d463024faf4e1dd0bb8d32c65f6ca.avif?t=1728901914\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7f Serve moviegoers their favorite snacks and keep them satisfied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfec Upgrade your shop to handle the ever-growing, insatiable crowds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Harvest pockets (and possibly organs) to meet your quotas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Customize your experience with spooky collectibles</p></li></ul>",
